# Electro, Assaulting Battery: "When Electro leaves the battlefield, you may pay {X}. When you do, he deals X damage to
# target player." The rulings: X is chosen as the ability resolves, and the reflexive ability's target is chosen when it
# triggers. Once Electro has left, the red mana he kept is lost as the step under way ends. Turn 1: Black Lotus pays for
# Electro, and Mox Ruby and a Mountain add {R}{R}, which he keeps. Turn 3: Mox Ruby adds {R}, and Bot1 Lightning Bolts
# its own Electro. Electro's trigger adds {R} first ({R}{R}{R}), then Bolt kills him. Bot1 pays X = 2 and targets Bot2,
# who takes exactly 2. The {R} left over is still there in the main phase and gone at the beginning of combat.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mountain
Electro, Assaulting Battery
Lightning Bolt
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Electro, Assaulting Battery.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Mana = {R}{R}
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Electro, Assaulting Battery)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Mana = {R}{R}{R}
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.PayCost(X: 2)
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Life = 18
? Bot1.Mana = {R}
[T3 Bot1.BeginCombat]

[Expect]
Bot1.Mana =
Bot2.Life = 18
Bot1.Graveyard = Electro, Assaulting Battery; Lightning Bolt; Black Lotus
